500, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "890": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD\n\nen-CA -\u003e 4096ca47f233\nes-AR -\u003e 3241f7c99958\nhi-IN -\u003e ad0eae569e22\noc -\u003e d3d913dbfdcb\npl -\u003e aa6698ab49c7\npt-BR -\u003e a43fd16fd998\nsk -\u003e 1340b92f7015\nsv-SE -\u003e aa5df627b5a2\nuk -\u003e a6394e22e041", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "32d37e0d0e99ce01128901ccd3a09cc33687a1da", "parents": ["46f93aeb2b8df0581959e49f32be331d9d82f970"], "tags": []}], "date": 1582135038, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "891": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1608256 - Remove MakeMRegExpHoistable optimization. r=tcampbell, a=RyanVM\n\nIt's a lot of code and doesn't seem to affect Octane-regexp.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D61427", "files": ["js/src/jit/Ion.cpp", "js/src/jit/IonAnalysis.cpp", "js/src/jit/IonAnalysis.h", "js/src/jit/Lowering.cpp", "js/src/jit/MIR.h", "js/src/vm/CommonPropertyNames.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "963fcf01cc5587850441e9ac1350565d07fbecc7", "parents": ["32d37e0d0e99ce01128901ccd3a09cc33687a1da"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dan Minor \u003cdminor@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1613765 - Cherry pick upstream sctp revision 790a7a2; r=ng, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D62071", "files": ["netwerk/sctp/src/netinet/sctp_auth.c", "netwerk/sctp/src/netinet/sctp_pcb.c"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "49a71f8da37664622002e8373f2f521a3e479e37", "parents": ["963fcf01cc5587850441e9ac1350565d07fbecc7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dan Minor \u003cdminor@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1613765 - Cherry pick upstream sctp revision 0d166e; r=ng, a=RyanVM\n\nDepends on D62071\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D62072", "files": ["netwerk/sctp/src/netinet/sctp.h", "netwerk/sctp/src/netinet/sctp_usrreq.c"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "818216eb93bde5f034809ab1369cb96cd4e631c5", "parents": ["49a71f8da37664622002e8373f2f521a3e479e37"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1543331 - Add a null check before calling mHostResolver-\u003eFlushCache(). r=dragana, a=RyanVM\n\nframe #5 of report https://crash-stats.mozilla.org/report/index/4dca6cb1-8d45-4bf5-8836-216810200217\n\nThis crash was rather obvious in retrospect, but I missed it because I was\nlooking at the wrong thing. We're not actually crashing in FlushCache,\ninstead mHostResolver is null in nsDNSService::Observe\n\nWhat made it obvious is frame #5 of report https://crash-stats.mozilla.org/report/index/4dca6cb1-8d45-4bf5-8836-216810200217\nIncluded here because crash reports expire:\n\n```\n1   libxul.so   nsHostResolver::FlushCache(bool)  netwerk/dns/nsHostResolver.cpp:740\n2   libxul.so   nsDNSService::Observe(nsISupports*, char const*, char16_t const*)   netwerk/dns/nsDNSService2.cpp:1132\n3   libxul.so   nsObserverList::NotifyObservers(nsISupports*, char const*, char16_t const*)   xpcom/ds/nsObserverList.cpp:66\n4   libxul.so   nsObserverService::NotifyObservers(nsISupports*, char const*, char16_t const*)  xpcom/ds/nsObserverService.cpp:295\n5   libxul.so   DecreasePrivateDocShellCount()  docshell/base/nsDocShell.cpp:306\n6   libxul.so   nsDocShell::Destroy()   docshell/base/nsDocShell.cpp:5076\n```\n\nSee the code points to this line:\nhttps://hg.mozilla.org/releases/mozilla-esr68/annotate/ef373efc995d9350a676c4c231b344d173423e8a/docshell/base/nsDocShell.cpp#l306\n\nAs we can see, it emits the \"last-pb-context-exited\" notification,\nand nsDNSService tries to call FlushCache.\nHowever, it appears this notification may be called after we get the shutdown\nnotification and we null out the pointer. It's unclear why this crash was not\nnoticed before bug 1450893 landed.\n\nDepends on D63107\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D63108", "files": ["netwerk/dns/nsDNSService2.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5a343dfa945b4555b2a2dd1abc99a5bdb66b72c0", "parents": ["818216eb93bde5f034809ab1369cb96cd4e631c5"], "tags": []}], "date": 1582148770, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "892": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD\n\ndsb -\u003e 548102e8e4c9\nel -\u003e 0fe0778d35fc\nen-GB -\u003e 66882c1b199b\nhr -\u003e 06ec967713e6\nhsb -\u003e 6a195f69030d\nhu -\u003e 4b5564f969bb\nit -\u003e ede6e5fdc007\nko -\u003e acd0707525c5\nnb-NO -\u003e d3d3db659071\noc -\u003e ce86705c5c9f\nvi -\u003e 2de892af148e", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b80cf221de65ae71b45b8873ecbbbe3b73a57043", "parents": ["5a343dfa945b4555b2a2dd1abc99a5bdb66b72c0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1582188923, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "893": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD\n\ncy -\u003e 3b43820acd92\neu -\u003e b7933752118c\nfr -\u003e 7a4934d3c7c8\nhr -\u003e 590fdec49c80\noc -\u003e 72c811a7a355\nrm -\u003e edb82a090531", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "40b77980bf03b9a5b718cd000bac2210af01e535", "parents": ["b80cf221de65ae71b45b8873ecbbbe3b73a57043"], "tags": []}], "date": 1582205056, "git